m=A.a([m,c?"Reassemble from the bottom up; the last piece is usually an edge: turn the layer 45\xb0 and press it in.":"L\u1eafp l\u1ea1i t\u1eeb d\u01b0\u1edbi l\xean; m\u1ea3nh cu\u1ed1i th\u01b0\u1eddng l\xe0 m\u1ed9t c\u1ea1nh: xoay l\u1edbp 45\xb0 r\u1ed3i \u1ea5n v\xe0o."],s)
